      "text": "At March 31, 2026, the facility had no outstanding borrowings and approximately $824 million of additional borrowing capacity after taking into consideration $32 million of outstanding letters of credit; principal amounts outstanding under the facility mature on June 5, 2029.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CYH-000119312526170557-0094",
          "quote": "At March 31, 2026, we had no outstanding borrowings and approximately $824 million of additional borrowing capacity (after taking into consideration $32 million of outstanding letters of credit)"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "CYH-000119312526170557-0094",
          "quote": "Principal amounts outstanding under the ABL Facility, if any, will be due and payable in full on June 5, 2029."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "For {{p:LTM}}, liquidity coverage was {{m:liquidity_coverage:LTM}}, compared with {{m:liquidity_coverage:FY0}} for {{p:FY0}}.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "In {{p:LTM}}, cash from operations of {{m:cfo:LTM}} was below capital expenditure of {{m:capex:LTM}}, while cash and cash equivalents of {{m:cash:LTM}} exceeded short-term debt of {{m:short_term_debt:LTM}}; dividends were {{m:dividends:LTM}}.",
      "citations": []
    }
  ]
}

{
  "claims": [
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "In {{p:FY0}}, scheduled maturities were {{m:maturity_year_1:FY0}} in year one, {{m:maturity_year_2:FY0}} in year two, {{m:maturity_year_3:FY0}} in year three, {{m:maturity_year_4:FY0}} in year four, {{m:maturity_year_5:FY0}} in year five and {{m:maturity_after_year_5:FY0}} thereafter.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "Debt due within 24 months was {{m:debt_due_24m:FY0}}, or {{m:share_due_24m:FY0}} of total debt, in {{p:FY0}}.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "quantitative",
      "text": "Near-term maturity cover in {{p:FY0}} was {{m:near_term_maturity_cover:FY0}}.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "In {{p:FY-1}}, CHS completed the offering of an additional $1.225 billion aggregate principal amount of its outstanding 10.875% Senior Secured Notes due 2032 tack-on notes.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CYH-000119312526059509-0315",
          "quote": "On June 5, 2024, CHS completed the offering of an additional $1.225 billion aggregate principal amount of its outstanding 10.875% Senior Secured Notes due 2032"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Proceeds from that offering, together with cash on hand, were used to redeem all of the remaining $1.116 billion of outstanding 8.000% Senior Secured Notes due 2026 and extinguish $130 million principal amount of the 6⅞% Senior Notes due 2028.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CYH-000119312526059509-0315",
          "quote": "together with cash on hand, were used to redeem all of the remaining $1.116 billion of outstanding 8.000% Senior Secured Notes due 2026"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "CYH-000119312526059509-0315",
          "quote": "extinguishment of $130 million principal amount of the 6⅞% Senior Notes due 2028"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "The ABL Facility and the indentures governing the outstanding notes contain restricted covenants and financial ratios and tests, and a breach could result in a default under those agreements in which all amounts outstanding may become immediately due and payable.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CYH-000119312526059509-0316",
          "quote": "A breach of any of these covenants could result in a default under the ABL Facility and/or the indentures that govern our outstanding notes."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

